		title="Virtual Vehicle Depot Spawner Example (Minimal): the smallest working call - spawner object and spawn point are all that's required. Every vehicle type and side is allowed by default. The name of the spawner object will be what appears as the garage name. VVD is WIP and not recommended for live missions. See the Virtual Vehicle Depot Spawner Example (Full) composition to see and edit every option. Wiki: https://github.com/AdamWaldie/WaldosMissionPack/wiki/Virtual-Vehicle-Depot";
